WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:07.580
You're nothing but the son
of a filthy pirate!

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.100
Filthy?!

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:17.930
I feel for you.

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:21.300
You must truly hate your
great idiot of a father...

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:27.010
...for abandoning his family and village
because of his lust for treasure!

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:30.170
Don't you dare insult
my father any more!

00:02:57.970 --> 00:03:02.910
Only then will I inherit
her enormous fortune!

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:11.670
Hey, you guys!
Don't attack that girl!

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:46.680
"Expose the Plot!
Pirate Butler Captain Kuro"

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:06.310
Our captain's been gone
a long time...

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:08.240
Luffy, too.

00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:11.050
<i>It was a big shock for him...</i>

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:15.040
He always watches the sea from
the shore when he's feeling down!

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:22.750
--Captain!
--Captain!

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:32.630
Huh? Wasn't Luffy with him?

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.200
--Captain!
--Captain!

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:40.200
Where's Luffy? Wasn't he
at the shore with...

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:48.150
<i>Is he still mad about
his dad being insulted?</i>

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:51.350
Who knows.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.620
No, that look was different!

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.520
Yeah, something
must've happened!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:58.890
Why do you suppose he
looked so desperate?!

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:01.630
Hey, how do we get
to this shore of yours?

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:03.830
Doesn't this smell
like an incident?!

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:05.970
Yeah, something must've
happened at the shore!

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:08.570
I think this calls for
the Usopp Pirates!

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:11.130
Alright, already!
How do we get there?!

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:21.510
T-terrible... news...

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:27.990
Terrible news, everyone!

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:32.120
Pirates are going to attack!

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:39.430
Tomorrow morning, pirates are
going to attack this village!

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:42.800
Everyone, run away!
Everyone...

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:46.970
What are you all doing?!
Everyone!

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:57.450
Alright, Usopp!
Enough is enough!

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:01.520
You're gonna pay once
and for all!

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:04.120
N-no, it's not like that!

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:05.560
It's the truth this time!

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:08.730
Shut up! All you ever do
is spout huge lies!

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:11.630
<i>If you were as honest
as Klahadore-san,</i>

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:13.290
<i>then we'd believe you!</i>

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:21.740
No matter what he does,
it won't matter.

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:26.250
Tomorrow morning, Jango.
Attack the village at daybreak!

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:27.650
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:32.750
<i>So he ignored me because
nobody'd believe me anyway?!</i>

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:41.050
Are these to your liking?

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:46.070
They're the ones you custom-ordered
from the eyewear shop...

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:48.000
...in the next town over.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:51.010
Yes, they're perfect!

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:54.340
I'm sorry for asking you to
go all the way there.

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:02.780
It's a present, isn't it?

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:05.490
Yes. Tomorrow is actually
exactly three years...

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:08.390
...since the day Klahadore
came to this mansion.

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:11.130
He's always taken
good care of me, so...

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:13.730
<i>Klahadore-san will be delighted!</i>

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:15.060
Yes!

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:20.330
Please, hear me out, everyone!

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:23.300
Pirates really are going
to attack tomorrow morning!

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:25.810
If we believed every story
you ever told,

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:28.140
we'd have fled the village
hundreds of times by now!

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:31.050
Please, believe me!
We gotta get out of here!

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:34.110
They really are going
to kill everyone!

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:36.850
I swear it's the truth
this time!

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:39.290
<i>And we're gonna
get you this time!</i>

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:44.990
Dammit!

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:46.980
Get him!
Don't let him escape!

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:52.470
This is the place!

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:55.800
Our captain always heals
his emotional pain here!

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.800
<i>It is nice here!</i>

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.970
That straw hat guy isn't here...

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.750
It's pretty fragile here...

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:15.320
Nami. Don't fall now.

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:16.650
Yeah.

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:24.530
L-look! There!

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:25.770
--What the-?!
--There he is!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:28.430
--It's the straw hat guy!
--And his butt.

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:37.780
Luffy! How did this happen?!

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:39.310
--He fell!
--He's a goner!

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:40.980
So that's why our captain...

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:48.320
Quiet!

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:57.650
This guy...

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:07.670
Morning!

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:38.470
<i>Usopp-san!</i>

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.580
Thank goodness!

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:49.910
I thought you might
never come back...

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:57.890
You gotta run, Kaya!
They're gonna kill you!

00:09:57.890 --> 00:10:01.960
Eh? What?

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:06.130
You've been tricked!
That butler is really a pirate!

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:17.030
Hold on.
What kind of joke is this?

00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:21.940
It's no joke!
I heard it with my own ears!

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:27.020
Klahadore's really a pirate who
weaseled his way into your mansion...

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:28.960
...so he could get your fortune!

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:31.360
He's been pretending to be a butler
for three years straight,

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.760
so he could get your fortune!

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:39.230
<i>What are you talking about,
Usopp-san?</i>

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:43.930
He said his crew's gonna storm
in and kill you at dawn tomorrow!

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:57.380
He's a really bad guy!
You gotta escape, quick!

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:01.990
I admit, he did say
too much earlier.

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:04.860
But lying like this...

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:08.330
<i>It's not like you, Usopp-san!</i>

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:11.160
No, it's not a lie...

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:17.100
It's the truth...

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:19.900
It's the truth!

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:38.290
<i>Eh?! They're going
to kill Kaya-san?!</i>

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:42.330
Are they really going to attack
the village?!

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:45.930
Yeah, that's what they said.
No question about it.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:53.410
So what were you sleeping
down here for?

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:54.910
That's the thing!

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:57.980
<i>I thought
I was up on the cliff...</i>

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:00.580
--So how'd I get down here?
--I knew it! Klahadore's a bad guy!

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:02.280
It's no wonder he seemed so creepy!

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:06.390
So that's why our captain ran to
the village with that intense look!

00:12:06.390 --> 00:12:07.550
That's great, then!

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:10.520
Now they'll know,
and can run away beforehand!

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:12.090
Talk about stupid bad guys!

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:15.100
Yeah, that's right!
We gotta run away, too!

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:16.800
Yeah! We gotta organize all
our prized possessions...

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.460
--...and hurry!
--...and hurry!

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:26.510
Oh no!

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:27.670
What is it?

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:31.010
We need to stock up on food before
the meat shop guy runs away!

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:34.200
That's not the issue at hand here.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:44.630
<i>Tell me, Usopp-san.</i>

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:48.360
What kind of story
do you have today?

00:12:48.360 --> 00:12:53.770
Right. Hmm, let's see...

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:55.470
Alright!

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:58.810
This story happened when
I was five,

00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:03.710
when I fought a giant goldfish
living in the southern sea!

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:06.810
Goldfish?
You fought a goldfish?

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:10.220
Yeah! It was so big,
not even a fish tank...

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:13.650
...the size of this mansion
could've held it!

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:15.320
Oh, my!

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:19.930
What first shocked me was...

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:23.400
...the immense size
and length of its poop!

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:26.630
It was so big that
I landed on it,

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:29.270
thinking it was
solid ground!

00:13:29.270 --> 00:13:30.470
That sounds fake!

00:13:30.470 --> 00:13:33.010
Yeah, it does, doesn't it?

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:35.640
But it's the truth!

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:43.520
So, first off, starting a bonfire
to dry off my clothes...

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:45.750
...was a bad idea.

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:46.550
How come?

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:49.020
Well, you see,
the goldfish's butt...

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:51.660
...caught on fire
and freaked it out!

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:53.330
Oh, dear!

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:55.200
Though I guess I can't
say I blame it.

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:58.690
It was so close to becoming
a grilled goldfish!

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:08.780
I... I loved them.

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:14.200
I loved the lies you told...

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:17.980
Yet, why are you saying this?

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:25.060
It's not like that! I'm not
trying to get back at Klahadore...

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:27.390
Why do you say it?

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:30.650
Kaya... I'm...

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:41.240
Is something the matter, Miss?!

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:49.680
You gotta escape, Kaya!

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:53.220
<i>Stop, Usopp-san!</i>

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:55.550
Let go of her!

00:14:56.890 --> 00:14:58.890
Just trust me!

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:01.030
You gotta get out of this village...

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:03.220
...before that butler gets back!

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:24.620
Stop!

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:29.190
Come on!

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:36.000
This'll all make sense
come tomorrow!

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.030
But you gotta escape
for now!

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:39.690
Please, listen to me!

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:50.970
You're pathetic.

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.680
Get away from her!

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.360
No!

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.380
Please, catch him!

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.950
He roughed up
the lady of the house!

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:32.610
--How horrible!
--How could he?!

00:16:36.860 --> 00:16:38.990
<i>Why...</i>

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:41.660
<i>won't anyone believe me?</i>

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:48.500
There he is! Get him!

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:56.780
<i>Usopp-san...</i>

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:59.710
Please pull yourself
together, Miss!

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:10.890
Thank you for coming, men.

00:17:10.890 --> 00:17:13.730
It's truly been three long years.

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:16.300
Once this plan succeeds,

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:21.600
I intend to give you all
plenty of the take.

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:23.140
At dawn tomorrow,

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:25.730
destroy the village
to your hearts' content!

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:43.990
Who are you?!

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:48.190
I'm Usopp!
A brave warrior of the sea!

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:50.860
I hear you've
been unhappy lately!

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:53.000
I'll cheer you up
with a story!

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:55.000
Mind your own business!

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:57.200
Please leave!
I'll call for someone!

00:17:57.200 --> 00:18:02.680
Now, now, don't sweat it!
I'm always meddlesome!

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:07.710
When I was three, my meddling
even led me to save a sick whale!

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:08.850
Eh? A whale?

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.050
You bet!

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:12.520
It was huge, and had
a really sore throat,

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:15.960
so I went inside its mouth,
but it thought I was food!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:23.690
Tomorrow morning, Jango.
Attack the village at daybreak!

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:33.400
--Captain!
--Captain!

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:37.630
Oh, hey, guys!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:41.380
Yo!

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:44.750
You're alive?!

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:48.190
Alive? Yeah,
I just woke up!

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:50.090
This guy was asleep
the whole time!

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:53.190
Anyways, Captain!
We heard everything!

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:56.690
Let's hurry and tell everyone
about the pirates!

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:00.860
Tell everyone?

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:05.170
You're pathetic.

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:10.600
Shut up! All you ever do
is spout huge lies!

00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:16.750
<i>If you were as honest
as Klahadore-san,</i>

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:18.410
<i>then we'd believe you!</i>

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:36.800
I'm lying like usual,
obviously!

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:38.910
That damn butler
pissed me off,

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:41.600
so I decided to claim
he's a pirate!

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:44.910
Oh!

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:48.110
So you put the straw hat
guy up to it, too!

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:54.490
Hey? What's wrong?

00:19:54.490 --> 00:19:57.420
I think less of you now.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:58.160
Me too.

00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:59.260
Me too!

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:01.260
<i>Even if that butler is a jerk,</i>

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:05.900
I never thought you'd lie
to hurt someone!

00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:09.300
We really respected you, too!

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:11.170
I was all wrong about him!

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:12.340
Same here!

00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:13.340
Let's go home!

00:20:13.340 --> 00:20:15.210
Yeah! It's suppertime!

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:17.200
Wonder what we're having...

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.710
Oww!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:40.800
There, all done!

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:43.340
Why did you tell them that?

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:45.670
Because I'm a liar.

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:51.480
They were never going to believe
me from the start.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:54.350
I was too optimistic.

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:57.340
Even so, the truth is the truth.

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:03.320
Pirates really are going to come,
aren't they?

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:05.860
Yeah. They're definitely
gonna show up.

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:08.330
But everyone thinks it's a lie.

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:12.320
They think tomorrow'll be just
another normal, peaceful day...

00:21:17.870 --> 00:21:21.010
That's why I'm going to stop
the pirates at the beach tomorrow...

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:23.180
...and make sure this stays a lie!

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:26.840
That's the only logical thing
for a liar like me to do!

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:31.480
Even if I get shot
in the arm,

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:34.350
even if I'm driven off
with brooms...

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:36.460
...this is my village!

00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:38.720
I love this village!

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:43.900
I want to protect everyone!

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:45.630
You're one hell of a nice guy,

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:48.200
pushing your henchmen away
and going into battle alone!

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:51.670
Just so you know, I have dibs
on all the pirates' treasure!

00:21:51.670 --> 00:21:54.140
Alright! We'll help you out!

00:21:54.140 --> 00:21:58.980
You guys... are going
to fight with me?! Why?

00:21:58.980 --> 00:22:01.950
There's a whole bunch
of bad guys, right?

00:22:01.950 --> 00:22:04.350
"Scared" is written
all over your face.

00:22:04.350 --> 00:22:06.020
M-me, scared?!

00:22:06.020 --> 00:22:09.020
I'm perfectly okay with
lots of bad guys or whatever!

00:22:09.020 --> 00:22:14.190
Because I'm Captain Usopp,
brave warrior of the sea!

00:22:16.660 --> 00:22:19.570
Dammit! Dammit!
This isn't a show!

00:22:19.570 --> 00:22:21.770
These are Klahadore's pirates
we're dealing with!

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:24.740
Of course I'm scared!
What's wrong with that?!

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:29.680
I don't want your sympathy!
You guys can leave! Leave!

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:34.170
We ain't laughing! We're helping
'cause we think you're honorable!

00:22:35.180 --> 00:22:38.150
As if we'd risk our lives
because of sympathy!

00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:47.260
Oh... You guys...

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:26.930 --> 00:23:36.930
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:45.420
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.420 --> 00:23:52.490
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.490 --> 00:24:02.490
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
